{
  "title": "Aromatic Amazing Peruvian Chicken Skewers",
  "description": "This Peruvian dish is a flavorful and crunchy meal prep option, featuring sriracha and lardons-render for a pungent taste, and is satvik-friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Peruvian",
  "diet": [
    "satvik"
